# guid: 6d1f8a42-9c3e-4b75-a2d6-0e7b4c9f3a18
# last-edited: 2026-09-25
#
# Ledger of every operation def ID this server has registered, canonical IDs
# and FormerIDs (aliases) alike. APPEND-ONLY. Read by
# internal/server/op_id_aliases_test.go (TestOpIDs_NoRenameWithoutAlias): every
# line must still resolve, so renaming an op without adding its old ID to the
# new def's FormerIDs fails the build.
#
# Seeded 2026-09-25 from a full boot (server ops + every sdk plugin's
# OperationDefs) at the commit that introduced op-ID aliases. It cannot contain
# IDs retired before that date without an alias (e.g. "maintenance.job",
# retired 2026-08-19); those are only discoverable from a production store's
# opv2:def: keyspace and operations_v2 rows.
#
# When you add an op, append its ID. When you rename one, keep the old line,
# add the new one, and list the old ID in FormerIDs.
